, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVf0wXQG", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 18, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8888920, "raw_content": "He worked as a beaurocrat in government trying to get Muslims free healthcare in Michigan.\n\nHis claim to fame is cancelling nearly $1billion in medical debt held by people in Michigan.\n\nBut, it's false. \n\nAlso, the hospital has to be willing to literally lose the money by selling the debt and getting paid pennies on it. \n\nWhat would happen if a hospital loses hundreds of millions of dollars?\n\nWell now the hospital needs a government bailout. \n\n2 stints, 2 - 3 years each his whole career only 6 years experience in two roles.\n\nThe rest of his life spent trying to start up a podcast pushing American pharmaceutical industry propaganda and write books on the same topic.\n\nHe's a fraud. \n\n", "author": "AmericanSpiritAlive", "created": 1792154134646, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "okboomer59", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Abdul El-Sayed is not a Doctor he's only had 2 jobs totaling roughly 6 years. ", "last_comment_created": 1792162958752, "content": "<p>He worked as a beaurocrat in government trying to get Muslims free healthcare in Michigan.</p>\n<p>His claim to fame is cancelling nearly $1billion in medical debt held by people in Michigan.</p>\n<p>But, it's false.</p>\n<p>Also, the hospital has to be willing to literally lose the money by selling the debt and getting paid pennies on it.</p>\n<p>What would happen if a hospital loses hundreds of millions of dollars?</p>\n<p>Well now the hospital needs a government bailout.</p>\n<p>2 stints, 2 - 3 years each his whole career only 6 years experience in two roles.</p>\n<p>The rest of his life spent trying to start up a podcast pushing American pharmaceutical industry propaganda and write books on the same topic.</p>\n<p>He's a fraud.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 1, "score_up": 18, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVf22SyD", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 12, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8889095, "raw_content": "", "author": "Sea_Still", "created": 1792160807782, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "thepostmillennial.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVf22SyD.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://thepostmillennial.com/tacoma-grocer-charged-with-pocketing-600000-in-federal-food-aid-extradited-from-india-after-fleeing-charges", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Tacoma grocer charged with pocketing $600,000 in federal food aid extradited from India after fleeing charges", "last_comment_created": 1792160807782, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 0, "score_up": 12, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "\u201cThose who take advantage of America\u2019s generosity must be held accountable